@startuml User Registration Sequence Diagram

!theme plain
title User Registration Use Case\n(רישום משתמש חדש)

actor "User\n(משתמש)" as User
participant "Register Page\n(דף רישום)" as RegisterPage
participant "Auth Reducer\n(Redux)" as AuthReducer
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Customer Auth Controller" as AuthController
participant "Customer Model\n(MongoDB)" as CustomerModel
participant "Seller Customer Model\n(Chat)" as ChatModel
participant "JWT Token Creator" as TokenCreator

User -> RegisterPage: Enter registration details\n(הזנת פרטי רישום)
activate RegisterPage

RegisterPage -> RegisterPage: Validate form data\n(בדיקת תקינות נתונים)

RegisterPage -> AuthReducer: dispatch(customer_register(info))
activate AuthReducer

AuthReducer -> API: POST /api/customer/register
activate API

API -> AuthController: customer_register(req, res)
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthController: Validate required fields\n(בדיקת שדות חובה)

AuthController -> CustomerModel: findOne({email})
activate CustomerModel
CustomerModel --> AuthController: Check if user exists\n(בדיקה אם משתמש קיים)
deactivate CustomerModel

alt User already exists
    AuthController --> API: 400 - Email already exists
    API --> AuthReducer: Error response
    AuthReducer --> RegisterPage: Show error message
    RegisterPage --> User: Display error\n(הצגת שגיאה)
else User doesn't exist
    AuthController -> AuthController: Hash password with bcrypt\n(הצפנת סיסמה)
    
    AuthController -> CustomerModel: create({name, email, hashedPassword})
    activate CustomerModel
    CustomerModel --> AuthController: New customer created\n(לקוח חדש נוצר)
    deactivate CustomerModel
    
    AuthController -> ChatModel: create({myId: customer.id})
    activate ChatModel
    ChatModel --> AuthController: Chat record created\n(רשומת צ'אט נוצרה)
    deactivate ChatModel
    
    AuthController -> TokenCreator: createToken({id, name, email, role: 'customer'})
    activate TokenCreator
    TokenCreator --> AuthController: JWT Token
    deactivate TokenCreator
    
    AuthController -> AuthController: Set HTTP-only cookie\n(הגדרת עוגיה מאובטחת)
    
    AuthController --> API: 201 - Registration successful + token
    deactivate AuthController
    
    API --> AuthReducer: Success response with token
    deactivate API
    
    AuthReducer -> AuthReducer: Store token in localStorage\n(שמירת טוקן במחסן מקומי)
    
    AuthReducer --> RegisterPage: Registration successful
    deactivate AuthReducer
    
    RegisterPage --> User: Redirect to dashboard/home\n(הפניה לדף הבית)
end

deactivate RegisterPage

note right of AuthController
  Password is hashed using bcrypt
  with salt rounds = 10
  (הסיסמה מוצפנת באמצעות bcrypt)
end note

note right of TokenCreator
  JWT token includes:
  - User ID
  - Name, Email
  - Role: 'customer'
  - Expiry: 7 days
end note

@enduml
